    "A player in a yellow shirt walking the baseline between points on a stadium court, the match clock reading one thirty-five": "一位穿黄色球衣的选手在中央球场分与分之间沿底线走动，比赛计时钟显示 1:35。",
    "Designed and built configuration agents automating business setup tasks, cutting manual configuration time by about 95%.": "设计并实现了自动完成业务设置任务的配置智能体，人工配置时间减少约 95%。",
    "Integrated Watson Discovery with cloud storage and LangChain so retrieval was as simple as dropping a file in a folder.": "把 Watson Discovery 与云存储和 LangChain 集成，检索简单到只需把文件放进一个文件夹。",
    "A matcha birthday cake ringed with raspberries and piped cream, with Happy Birthday written across a white disc on top": "一个抹茶生日蛋糕，围着一圈树莓和裱花奶油，顶上一块白色圆片写着「Happy Birthday」。",
    "Built an accuracy monitoring dashboard that attributes prediction variance to its root cause across wells and assets.": "搭建准确度监控看板，把预测偏差归因到井和资产层面的根本原因。",
    "Diagnosed and resolved the blocking issues, ensuring sensitive data stayed put and no unauthorised transfer occurred.": "定位并解决了阻塞性问题，确保敏感数据留在原地、没有发生未授权传输。",
    "Evaluated on mean absolute error; gains varied by part type and region, with the largest average improvement in APAC.": "以平均绝对误差评估；改善幅度随零件类型和地区而异，亚太地区平均改善最大。",
    "Led several AI-customisation streams, driving retrieval-augmented generation across structured and unstructured data.": "主导多条 AI 定制工作流，推进结构化与非结构化数据上的检索增强生成。",
    "Ran data validation and curation with SMEs; defined selection criteria and built the ingestion pipelines behind them.": "与业务专家一起做数据校验和整理，定义筛选标准并搭建配套的数据接入管道。",
    "The stone tower and fanned steel cables of the Brooklyn Bridge photographed from the walkway against a clear blue sky": "从人行道仰拍布鲁克林大桥的石塔和呈扇形展开的钢索，背景是万里无云的蓝天。",
    "A life-size astronaut statue holding up a carton of fries outside a McDonald's near Houston, under a heavy grey sky": "在阴沉的天空下，一座真人大小的宇航员雕像在休斯顿附近的麦当劳门口举着一盒薯条。",
