    "Ran discovery workshops to map the end-to-end review workflow and find where the manual bottlenecks actually were.": "组织需求发现工作坊，梳理端到端的审查流程，找出人工瓶颈真正在哪里。",
    "Replaced rule-based intent matching with an LLM-driven voice bot architecture, improving self-service containment.": "用大模型驱动的语音机器人架构替换规则式意图匹配，提升自助服务完结率。",
    "Worked across streams to stand up 30+ AI assistants that read documents, automate workflow steps and cut busywork.": "跨多条业务线建起 30 多个 AI 助手，用于阅读文档、自动化流程步骤、减少琐碎工作。",
    "Wrote orchestration logic that processes multi-row inputs from standard Excel templates, so setup runs in batches.": "编写编排逻辑处理标准 Excel 模板的多行输入，使配置可以批量执行。",
