    "Ran the parameter sweep — chunk size, chunk count, overlap, embedder, vector store, retrieval method, model mode.": "完成参数扫描——分块大小、分块数量、重叠、向量化模型、向量库、检索方式、模型模式。",
    "A player sprinting along the baseline of a stadium court to reach a ball, sponsor boards and a full crowd behind": "一位选手沿着中央球场底线全力冲刺救球，身后是赞助商广告板和满座的观众。",
    "Matcha green and dark chocolate thumbprint cookies pressed with chunks of chocolate, cooling on parchment paper": "抹茶绿和黑巧克力两种指印饼干，中间压入巧克力块，在烘焙纸上冷却。",
